WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inlet valve spring
What it does: Closes the valve and keeps the operating train in contact as the lobe descends.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Inlet valve spring
How it works: The spring stores energy as it compresses.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Inlet valve spring
How it moves: Compresses as the valve opens and extends as it closes; retains preload at rest.
